5cbf18f93","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/benc-uk-workflow-dispatch-1795cbf18f93.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0a7d63090279ac57cd4493643c215917db4a2cc29d1232db5557ffbfab7960b5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The action exposes outputs runId, runUrl, runUrlHtml, and workflowId describing the triggered workflow run."},{"claim_ids":["clm_48fc76b459966a6b51a16048da35f820d62c5fa90a0a2b2b580f9bc45fa3f609"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"By default workflows are triggered in the same repo; an optional `repo` input (owner/name) enables triggering in another repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_55e60e31c082f76692d9e1716ad43c506b219855fc5f1cc1cf1f5a48c655fdb5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Workflows triggered by this action appear in the GitHub UI as \"manually triggered\", since the action simulates the manual workflow_dispatch trigger."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5bbd03c504971e64a0da710c8c58a9c6d8e8320a7659ad3a7d5b73d32a855510"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The intended use case is chaining workflows, e.g. a CI build workflow triggering a CD deploy workflow, allowing separate CI/CD workflows that pass data between them."},{"claim_ids":["clm_62efcea2197d2796fcf407626b6f50ab4c95abb4309c2db4d9e01d809d639b27"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An optional `ref` input sets the Git reference (branch, tag, or commit SHA) for the triggered run; if omitted, the triggering workflow's context ref is used."},{"claim_ids":["clm_773d0a99079f5de9e41aed1cc476e26f8554f2e13e70175d6d2a040195f6cb78"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The `wait-timeout-seconds` input caps waiting at a default of 900 seconds (15 minutes), applying only when wait-for-completion is enabled."},{"claim_ids":["clm_77f1a4d8c9666b80d9e4d84fb2a3baf5204b83111a73acbd9289fd8974ad67ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The action triggers another GitHub Actions workflow using the workflow_dispatch event, and the target workflow must be configured for that event type."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ab9bbaa57f9fdc21277935e768b48616af8930bf3bad777aedb0f5f6ebaf8775"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The required `workflow` input accepts the target workflow's name, filename, or ID, and all three forms are used when looking up the workflow."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b55009ba4a706844940229229c032d80b0989f470803fd1c81cefd419a991c84"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An optional `inputs` parameter passes inputs to the target workflow as a JSON-encoded string, for workflows that have inputs configured."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b58084cd291ef269914f25524263ce4321732e65c35c792fa5f8c82c090e3d85"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Setting `wait-for-completion` to true makes the action poll the triggered run's status every 5 seconds until it finishes, with the interval configurable via `wait-interval-seconds`."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e82c34f2e54f92acd6b43e9d545f4a28b3a67c9fd93d8a2f2a18b0d8d5b3a505"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"By default the standard GITHUB_TOKEN is used, so users no longer need to supply their own token; cross-repo dispatch requires a PAT with repo rights passed via a secret."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ea7812eac26aae256d286a7384eef75f0576b16ea50b6b05f4d3a5bc15dab073"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"With `sync-status` set to true, the action fails if the triggered workflow run fails or is cancelled; this requires wait-for-completion to be enabled."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0a7d63090279ac57cd4493643c215917db4a2cc29d1232db5557ffbfab7960b5","clm_48fc76b459966a6b51a16048da35f820d62c5fa90a0a2b2b580f9bc45fa3f609","clm_55e60e31c082f76692d9e1716ad43c506b219855fc5f1cc1cf1f5a48c655fdb5","clm_5bbd03c504971e64a0da710c8c58a9c6d8e8320a7659ad3a7d5b73d32a855510","clm_62efcea2197d2796fcf407626b6f50ab4c95abb4309c2db4d9e01d809d639b27","clm_773d0a99079f5de9e41aed1cc476e26f8554f2e13e70175d6d2a040195f6cb78","clm_77f1a4d8c9666b80d9e4d84fb2a3baf5204b83111a73acbd9289fd8974ad67ca","clm_ab9bbaa57f9fdc21277935e768b48616af8930bf3bad777aedb0f5f6ebaf8775","clm_b55009ba4a706844940229229c032d80b0989f470803fd1c81cefd419a991c84","clm_b58084cd291ef269914f25524263ce4321732e65c35c792fa5f8c82c090e3d85","clm_e82c34f2e54f92acd6b43e9d545f4a28b3a67c9fd93d8a2f2a18b0d8d5b3a505","clm_ea7812eac26aae256d286a7384eef75f0576b16ea50b6b05f4d3a5bc15dab073"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4","id":"pg_81496c6a98c852c98235a64b9563d91b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/benc-uk-workflow-dispatch-readme-md-78e99d70d9ac-a64b9563d91b.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_07473cd804fe5f938e5f383946b265d5"],"title":"benc-uk/workflow-dispatch/README.md @ 78e99d70d9ac","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:38:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7fb31a86cee641918da5bd81b3ed30b4"}
